---
import EyebrowLabel from "../ui/EyebrowLabel.astro";
import CoalitionDiagram from "../ui/CoalitionDiagram.astro";
---

<section class="section" id="coalition">
  <div class="coalition__inner">
    <EyebrowLabel>The Differentiator</EyebrowLabel>
    <h2 class="section-title coalition__h2">
      First open-source platform with Puntos Apprecio support.
    </h2>
    <div class="coalition__body">
      <p class="section-body">
        In LATAM, coalition is how loyalty programs scale. Customers expect to
        earn and redeem across networks, not just inside a single brand.
        LoyaltyOS is the first open-source loyalty platform to ship a production
        coalition adapter for Puntos Apprecio — handling accumulation,
        redemption, and point conversion out of the box.
      </p>
      <p class="section-body">
        The same <code class="coalition__inline-code">CoalitionAdapter</code>
        interface lets you plug in any future network without forking the core.
        Build a <code class="coalition__inline-code">MyCoalitionAdapter</code>,
        register it in your config, and the points engine treats it as a
        first-class participant.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="coalition__diagram">
      <CoalitionDiagram />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .coalition__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .coalition__h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 792px;
  }

  .coalition__body {
    max-width: 588px;
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .coalition__inline-code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .coalition__diagram {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 956px;
    margin-top: var(--space-16);
  }
</style>
